### Variável do token (preenchida automaticamente pelo login abaixo)
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "usuario@upf.br",
    "password": "abc12345"
}

### Listar metas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar meta
POST http://localhost:3000/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetAmount": 5000,
    "deadline": "2026-12-31",
    "description": "Viagem de férias"
}

### Criar meta com prazo no passado (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetAmount": 1000,
    "deadline": "2020-01-01",
    "description": "Meta inválida"
}

### Atualizar progresso da meta
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/goals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentAmount": 5000
}

### Apagar meta
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/goals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}